    description: Some("A maze chase in the Bonnie-and-Clyde vein. You drive your getaway car through a city grid, robbing every bank in the maze while police cruisers give chase — blow a pursuer up with a stick of dynamite, but you carry only a few, and running out of fuel or getting cornered costs you a car. Clear all the banks and you move on to the next city."),
